  "description": "Powerful 250W Motor\n\nThe HILAND Montura E-Mountainbike features a reliable 250W motor, delivering smooth and powerful assistance. Whether you are tackling your daily commute, enjoying a weekend cruise, or exploring light off-road trails, it provides the perfect boost right when you need it.\n\nHigh-Capacity 10.4Ah Battery for Extended Range\n\nEquipped with an integrated 10.4Ah battery, this e-bike ensures consistent, long-lasting performance. It is the ideal companion for urban commuting, city rides, and extended weekend tours with comfortable pedal-assist.\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame & 28-Inch Wheels\n\nThe robust yet lightweight aluminum frame perfectly balances durability with agile handling. Paired with versatile 28-inch wheels, it guarantees a smooth, stable ride on everything from paved city streets to gravel forest paths.\n\nSmooth 7-Speed Drivetrain & Reliable V-Brakes\n\nThe precise 7-speed gear system allows you to adapt effortlessly to changing terrains and inclines. Trusted front and rear V-brakes deliver responsive stopping power, ensuring maximum safety during your daily rides.\n\n85% Pre-Assembled for Quick Setup\n\nSkip the hassle. The bike arrives 85% pre-assembled (85% SKD). With just a few simple final steps, your new e-bike is ready to hit the road in no time.",
